{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read manga, comics, magazines and photos from your harddrive in VR.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zoomable and grabbable pages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intuitive controls designed for manga/comics and small text</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Close reading mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick focus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Page tilting</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great resolution &amp; image compression </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supported files in early access: <strong>pdf</strong>, <strong>cbz</strong>, <strong>zip</strong>, <strong>jpg</strong>, <strong>jpeg</strong>,\u00a0<strong>png</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No advertising or other hidden costs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No online store, you have to have the content in your PC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Low system requirements. Tested on an older laptop with an AMD Ryzen 5 3550H, 8GB RAM, and an Nvidia GTX 1050, using a Meta Quest 2 via Steam Link.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668710/extras/VR-Reader-page.gif?t=1746047485\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668710?t=1746047485","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668710?t=1746047485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668710/897cf1da8e617141abb70f7a882a510d027403c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746047485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668710/897cf1da8e617141abb70f7a882a510d027403c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746047485","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read manga, comics, magazines and photos from